      "value": "https://i.imgur.com/pic0EKy.gif\n\n```\n\n.vrcat {\n\n    cursor: grab;\n\n    transform-origin: bottom center;\n\n    transition transform 0.1s ease;\n\n}\n\n.vrcat:active {\n\n    cursor: grabbing;\n\n    transform: scaleY(0.9) scaleX(1.1);\n\n}\n\n```",
